{
  "id": "E246",
  "title": "The Trendiest Color",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-08-12",
  "synopsis": "Li Li wears a t-shirt in the trendiest color without knowing it.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/812/c6b46dbce931e082b6fa76d6a45e18cae1f93765.mp3?1532935077",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "2018年的流行色\n\n安妮：李力，你今天穿了紫色的短袖，好潮啊！\n李力：什么？这就是一件普通的短袖呀。\n安妮：紫色是今年最流行的颜色！\n李力：真的吗？我都不知道。\n安妮：你去街上看看，很多时尚的女孩都穿着紫色的衣服。\n李力：那我怎么没见你穿？\n安妮：我刚买了一件，还没来得及穿呢。",
    "traditional": "2018年的流行色\n\n安妮：李力，你今天穿了紫色的短袖，好潮啊！\n李力：什麼？這就是一件普通的短袖呀。\n安妮：紫色是今年最流行的顏色！\n李力：真的嗎？我都不知道。\n安妮：你去街上看看，很多時尚的女孩都穿著紫色的衣服。\n李力：那我怎麼沒見你穿？\n安妮：我剛買了一件，還沒來得及穿呢。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Trendiest Color of 2018"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "安妮：李力，你今天穿了紫色的短袖，好潮啊！",
      "traditional": "安妮：李力，你今天穿了紫色的短袖，好潮啊！",
      "pinyin": "ān nī lǐ lì nǐ jīn tiān chuān le zǐ sè de duǎn xiù hǎo cháo a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Li Li, you’re wearing a purple t-shirt today! You are so trendy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "李力：什么？这就是一件普通的短袖呀。",
      "traditional": "李力：什麼？這就是一件普通的短袖呀。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì shén me zhè jiù shì yí jiàn pǔ tōng de duǎn xiù ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: What? It’s just a normal t-shirt."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "安妮：紫色是今年最流行的颜色！",
      "traditional": "安妮：紫色是今年最流行的顏色！",
      "pinyin": "ān nī zǐ sè shì jīn nián zuì liú xíng de yán sè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Purple is the most fashionable color this year!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "李力：真的吗？我都不知道。",
      "traditional": "李力：真的嗎？我都不知道。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì zhēn de ma wǒ dōu bù zhī dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Really? I had no idea."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "安妮：你去街上看看，很多时尚的女孩都穿着紫色的衣服。",
      "traditional": "安妮：你去街上看看，很多時尚的女孩都穿著紫色的衣服。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī nǐ qù jiē shang kàn kan hěn duō shí shàng de nǚ hái dōu chuān zhe zǐ sè de yī fu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: If you go out in the street, you will see many fashionable girls wearing purple clothes."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "李力：那我怎么没见你穿？",
      "traditional": "李力：那我怎麼沒見你穿？",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì nà wǒ zěn me méi jiàn nǐ chuān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Why haven’t I seen you wear any?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "安妮：我刚买了一件，还没来得及穿呢。",
      "traditional": "安妮：我剛買了一件，還沒來得及穿呢。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ gāng mǎi le yí jiàn hái méi lái de jí chuān ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I just bought a piece and I haven’t had time to wear it yet."
    }
